{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' __issue_context__.json\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"body\": \"Please check that the term does not already exist by using the ontology search tool OLS:\\nhttps://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/cl\\n\\n\\n**Preferred term label**\\nfibrochondrocyte progenitor cell \\n\\n**Synonyms** (add reference(s), please)\\nFCP- related synonym - abbreviation - PMID: [31871141](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31871141/)\\n\\n**Definition** (free text, with reference(s), please. PubMed ID format is PMID:XXXXXX)\\nA mesenchymal progenitor cell located in fibrocartilaginous tissues, along the fibrochondrocytic differentiation pathway that co-expresses both fibrochondrocyte markers (COL1A1, COL3A1) and mesenchymal stem cell markers (MCAM/CD146, MYLK) in humans. FCP demonstrates colony-forming capacity and multi-lineage differentiation potential toward osteogenic and adipogenic lineages. This cell serves as a progenitor for mature fibrochondrocytes and other meniscal cell types, with differentiation regulated by TGF-β signaling, focal adhesion, and extracellular matrix-receptor interaction pathways.\\n\\nPMID: [31871141](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31871141/)\\nPMID: [36338137](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36338137/)\\n\\n**Parent cell type term** (check the hierarchy here https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/cl)\\n\\nMesenchymal cell\\nProgenitor cell \\n\\n\\n**Anatomical structure where the cell type is found** (check Uberon for anatomical structures: https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/ontologies/uberon)\\n\\nPart of some ‘ fibrocartilage’\\nexpresses some 'cell surface glycoprotein MUC18'\\nexpresses some 'myosin light chain kinase, smooth muscle'\\nexpresses some 'collagen alpha-1(I) chain'\\nexpresses some 'collagen alpha-1(III) chain'\\n\\n\\n\\n**Your ORCID**\\nhttps://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277\\n\\n**Additional notes or concerns**\\nI will add a link to fibrochondrocyte - 'develops from' some 'fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell' once the term is added\\n\",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"NTR Fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell (FCP)\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3458\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
