{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '25610,25660p' src/ontology/cl-edit.owl\"","aggregated_output":"SubClassOf(obo:CL_0020018 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000007498))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_0020019 (regulatory chondrocyte)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30026257\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34045450\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37660146\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0020019 \"A chondrocyte located mainly in the superficial zone of articular cartilage. In healthy human cartilage, regulatory chondrocytes are characterized by expression of EIF5A, PGK1, ANXA1, and TUBA1A. During osteoarthritis, a distinct subpopulation expands, marked by high expression of CHI3L1, CHI3L2, CRTAC1, and AEBP1, with enrichment for signaling pathway regulation (including Toll-like receptor, mTOR, and TGF-beta signaling) and antigen-processing gene expression, with a small proportion expressing MHC class II genes, suggesting potential immune cell-like regulatory functions during osteoarthritis progression.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(dc:creator obo:CL_0020019 \"GitHub Copilot\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_0020019 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37660146\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0020019 \"RegC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0020019 \"regulatory chondrocyte\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0020019 obo:CL_0000138)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_0020020 (homeostatic chondrocyte)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:30026257\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34045450\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34400611\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37660146\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0020020 \"A chondrocyte identified in both healthy and osteoarthritic human articular cartilage, and in intervertebral disc tissue. In healthy articular cartilage, a homeostatic chondrocyte is characterised by the expression of TXNIP, IFITM3, GDF15, and TIMP1 (Wang et al., 2021), among other extracellular matrix and regulatory molecules. This cell maintains cartilage integrity by producing key ECM components and supporting baseline tissue homeostasis. In OA cartilage, this cell is enriched for genes related to cellular homeostasis modulation, including regulation of the cell cycle, development, and RNA metabolism (Ji et al., 2018).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(dc:creator obo:CL_0020020 \"GitHub Copilot\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_0020020 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37660146\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0020020 \"HomC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0020020 \"homeostatic chondrocyte\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0020020 obo:CL_0000138)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0020020 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0070278))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0020020 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_1990079))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_0700009 (obsolete kidney collecting duct beta-intercalated cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:24051376\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:31300091\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32016094\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0700009 \"OBSOLETE. A renal beta-intercalated cell that is part of the cortical collecting duct. The medullary collecting duct does not contain the renal beta-intercalated cell type.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 obo:CL_0700009 obo:CL_4030005)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_0700009 \"2022-08-26T10:31:29Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32016094\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0700009 \"B-IC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:31300091\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0700009 \"kidney collecting duct intercalated cell type B\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0700009 \"Created with IRI in incorrect ID range\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0700009 \"obsolete kidney collecting duct beta-intercalated cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated obo:CL_0700009 \"true\"^^xsd:boolean)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_1000001 (retrotrapezoid nucleus neuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000001 \"retrotrapezoid nucleus neuron\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_1000001 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000540 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0009918)))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_1000022 (mesonephric nephron tubule epithelial cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000022 \"mesonephric nephron tubule epithelial cell\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_1000022 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000066 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0005329)))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_1000036 (obo:CL_1000036)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000231 obo:CL_1000036 obo:IAO_0000227)\nAnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 obo:CL_1000036 obo:CL_0002196)\nAnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated obo:CL_1000036 \"true\"^^xsd:boolean)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_1000042 (forebrain neuroblast)\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
